            <div xml:id="d342">

                <pb facs="0389" n="377" xml:id="pg377"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">835.01/65: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Argentina</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Armour</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Buenos
                                Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-06-09T20:00:00-03:00">June 9, 1943—8
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 8:02 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>1272. Embassy’s telegram No. 1269, June 9, 6 p.m. Have just been informed Chile,
                    Paraguay and Bolivia gave their recognition this evening. I understand Uruguay
                    will probably follow tonight.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Armour</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
